    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d140">

                <pb facs="0262" n="156" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg156"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Hicks.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-20">August 20,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Roosevelt has cabled directly to President of Chile an expression of
                    intense sympathy felt at the appalling disaster that has befallen her. You will
                    supplement this by the proper representations at the foreign office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
